      "text": "```\nHOW TO SCAN A LINE\n-------------------\n1. Mark natural speech stresses (ignore the meter first)\n2. Identify the dominant foot pattern\n3. Scan with dominant pattern but allow variation\n4. Mark variations (inversions, extra syllables, etc.)"
