        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Poetry Forms and Prosody",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nSESTINA END-WORD ROTATION\n---------------------------\n6 end-words: let them be A B C D E F"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POETRY-FORMS.md#029",
      "path": [
        "05-POETRY-FORMS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:literature:05-poetry-forms, git-history:literature:05-poetry-forms]",
